      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I could see a world accessing ebooks. But even then it won't be through something from the unity store. \n\nGames like this have component white lists. Gotta have a strict limit on what can be used to have good controls over security\n\nThe one thing that was added recently is remote image loading and through that you could show people screenshots of a PDF. For reading a book I've seen a world where they count the length of a video, and every 5 seconds is a frame of a slideshow. Might be 4 seconds, they intend you to use thier tool to produce the slideshow. Something like sliden\n\nAnyways back to your topic, it's unlikely to add items that complicated to avatars",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
