  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-07-18T00:37:20.469Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Good afternoon,\n\nI don't know enough about VRC or Unity to know if its possible, but I'm a big lover of books and have been dying to be able to read books with friends on VRChat for some time. I know that unity has packages that support importing and parsing Epub and PDF files and I'd absolutely love to use that for a sort of.. on avatar eReader asset that can load those kinds of files. Only problem is, I have no idea whether VRChat allows this or has a way for this to work. \n\nIs this possible already? If not, is there any chance that this may become a possibility in the future? \n\nThank you so much in advance to anyone who takes the time to read this! You guys have created a wonderful game, thank you for all y'all do.",
